# Cloudflare Pages 301 Redirect Rules
# Enforce canonical www domain and strip .html extensions

# 1. Apex to www domain canonicalization
https://marstersdigital.com/* https://www.marstersdigital.com/:splat 301!
http://marstersdigital.com/* https://www.marstersdigital.com/:splat 301!
http://www.marstersdigital.com/* https://www.marstersdigital.com/:splat 301!

# 2. Strip .html extensions
/index.html / 301
/*.html /:splat 301
